<title>UK: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITION FIXTURES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITION FIXTURES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following matches are being</p>
<p>played in the UEFA Cup and European Cup Champions' League this</p>
<p>week (GMT kickoff times):</p>
<p>Tuesday, December 3</p>
<p>UEFA Cup, third round, second legs:</p>
<p>1930 Hamburg (Germany) v Monaco (France)</p>
<p>1530 Karlsruhe (Germany) v Brondby (Denmark)</p>
<p>1930 Feyenoord (Netherlands) v Tenerife (Spain)</p>
<p>1930 Anderlecht (Belgium) v Helsingborg (Sweden)</p>
<p>1900 Newcastle United (England) v Metz (France)</p>
<p>1730 Schalke (Germany) v Club Brugge (Belgium)</p>
<p>1845 Boavista (Portugal) v Internazionale Milan (Italy)</p>
<p>1800 Besiktas (Turkey) v Valencia (Spain)</p>
<p>Wednesday November 20</p>
<p>Champions' League</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>1930 Grasshopper (Switzerland) v Ajax (Netherlands)</p>
<p>1930 Auxerre (France) v Rangers (Scotland)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>1930 Borussia Dortmund (Germany) v Steaua Bucharest (Romania)</p>
<p>1930 Atletico Madrid (Spain) v Widzew Lodz (Poland)</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>1930 Juventus (Italy) v Fenerbahce (Turkey)</p>
<p>1930 Rapid Vienna (Austria) v Manchester United (England)</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>1930 AC Milan (Italy) v Rosenborg Trondheim (Norway)</p>
<p>1930 IFK Gothenburg (Sweden) v Porto (Portugal)</p>
